<title>FRANCE: BoF official says euro must be as solid as franc.</title>
<headline>BoF official says euro must be as solid as franc.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France deputy governor Herve Hannoun said on Wednesday that the future European single currency must be as solid and as credible as the franc.</p>
<p>He told a conference on the euro that the objective of the future European central bank was to maintain price stability.</p>
<p>&quot;The euro must be as solid and credible as the franc,&quot; he said.  </p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
